# Netlify redirects and rewrites
# Reverb routes ship as pre-rendered HTML files (dist/reverb/**/index.html) so
# crawlers read real meta tags and JSON-LD. No rewrite here — a forced rewrite
# would shadow those files. Unknown paths still hit the SPA fallback below.


# Proxy storage/image masking requests to Supabase Edge Functions
/api/*  https://xxigtbxqgbdcfpmnrzvp.supabase.co/functions/v1/:splat  200

# Keep Lovable-hosted assets out of the SPA fallback
/__l5e/*  /__l5e/:splat  200

# Handle client-side routing - redirect all non-file requests to index.html
/*    /index.html   200

# Optional: Handle specific error codes with custom pages
# /404.html  404
# /500.html  500